Torabo-Float
Copyright 2026 tak-2025

This product includes code adapted from ZMK Studio and from Torabo-Studio (an
unofficial ZMK Studio fork), both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The adapted code includes the keyboard rendering (Key / PhysicalLayout /
HidUsageLabel / hid-usages) and the ZMK Studio RPC client wiring.

