Torabo-Float-Web
Copyright 2026 tak-2025

This product is the browser build of Torabo-Float and reuses that project's
source directly: the live_feed decoder, the keyboard rendering, the keymap sync
and cache schema, and the stylesheet. The native (Tauri / Rust `bluest`) BLE
transport is replaced by a Web Bluetooth implementation written for this
project.

Torabo-Float-Web is an unofficial companion tool for the torabo-tsuki keyboard.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the ZMK Project. It is distributed
under the same Apache License, Version 2.0.
